    "final": "Lowest buyable XS price for the Quenby tee: $11.35, charged by Ashgrove Clothing Co (Quenby Midweight Jersey Tee - Ashgrove Clothing Co, /igr-rp28-28.html). XS is in stock there and can be added to cart (verified in cart: subtotal $11.35). I opened all 45 tee listings found in the search results (36 on page 1 and 9 on page 2) and checked the XS option on every one. Of those 45: 27 sell a buyable XS (Ashgrove $11.35 is the lowest; next cheapest are Pembroke Threads $12.58, Fordwich Garments $12.70, Garrick Workwear $13.10), 11 have XS listed but out of stock/disabled (Foxcombe Apparel, Westmere Garments, Haldane Garment Works, Grantley Outfitters, Bramley Threads, Oakfield Outfitters, Everleigh Textiles, Fairhaven Outfitters, Marlow Apparel, Dovercourt Clothing, Rookwood Workwear), and 7 offer no XS at all (Pentland Garment Works, Brindle Threads, Thornbury Textile Company, Lymington Apparel, Redhill Garments, Carnforth Apparel, Gisburn Clothing Co). No other product types appeared in the results to be excluded. Note: where dropdown labels advertised an XS 'Promo' price, the actual charged price (confirmed via cart) was the product-page price, e.g. Fordwich $12.70 not $9.98.",
